# Config Package (`packages/config`)

This package provides shared configuration files (JSON) for TypeScript and Node.js projects in the Skyjo monorepo.

## Key Files & Directories:
- **[`ts/`](mdc:packages/config/ts)**: TypeScript and Node.js base config files.
  - **[`base-package.json`](mdc:packages/config/ts/base-package.json)**: Base config for package.json files.
  - **[`base-node.json`](mdc:packages/config/ts/base-node.json)**: Base config for Node.js projects.
  - **[`package.json`](mdc:packages/config/ts/package.json)**: Config package metadata.

## Notes
- Used as a dependency by other packages for consistent configuration.
- No runtime logic; only static config files.